Vehicle models (Blender GLB fleet)
---------------------------------
Volvo 240, Saab 900 Classic T16, civilian and police XC70 P2, Chevrolet Impala
1970 hardtop, Nissan Micra K11 and Volvo Duett P210 EPA pickup:
Copyright (c) 2026 Axel Tidehorn. Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Sources: docs/vehicle-fleet.md and media/vehicles/NOTICE.txt record the
immutable source revisions and editable masters for each model.
The GLBs are original authored geometry; no reference photographs or external
3D meshes are embedded. The police markings are original stylized artwork.
No endorsement by Volvo, Saab or the Swedish Police is implied.
Attribution: "Vehicle models by Axel Tidehorn, CC BY 4.0". Indicate changes
when distributing modified versions and retain the licence link.

